   1184  f1fd							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1185  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1186  f1fd							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1187  f1fd							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1188  f1fd							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1189  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1190  f1fd				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1191  f1fd							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
