   2086  f5fb							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2087  f5fb							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2088  f5fb							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2089  f5fb							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2090  f5fb							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2091  f5fb							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2092  f5fb							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2093  f5fb							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2094  f5fb							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2095  f5fb							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2096  f5fb							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2097  f5fb				   CEH_Key
   2098  f5fb		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   2099  f5fd		       1d c4 f3 	      ora	EnemyBitTable,X
