   2107  f609							; UEDispatch — the enemy-type dispatch tail, moved out of UpdateEnemies into the
   2108  f609							; $F82C pin gap (upstream of the $F8DD sprite pin, so the pre-pad END is
   2109  f609							; unaffected and the 15 B the folded chain frees stays free). Every non-raft arm
   2110  f609							; tail-jumps, exactly like the old inline chain, so the stack depth is unchanged.
   2111  f609							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
