   2140  f62d							; SelectActiveObject — choose the single GRP1 object to draw this frame (A1
   2141  f62d							; revert: back in bank0; C1's bank2 copy is gone). TIA has one GRP1 sprite, so
   2142  f62d							; objects flicker by rotating slots. Sets ObjBase, ActiveObjectX,
   2143  f62d							; ActiveObjectY, ObjTop, COLUP1 and P1's hardware X (SetObjectXPos).
   2144  f62d							; Slot count (enemies + miner?) lives in Temp for this VBLANK only.
