   2565  f8c6							; YToRowTable — convert scanline to 48-line band row (0-2), idx A>>2
   2566  f8c6							; ==============================================================================
   2567  f8c6							; The jsr wrapper that used to live here was dead (PlayerHitsMap inlines the
   2568  f8c6							; lsr/lsr/tay/lda lookup — saves 2 JSR stack push levels to keep SP >= $F8)
   2569  f8c6							; and was removed in S1.6. Table rationale: the old subtract loop grew
   2570  f8c6							; linearly with RoomY and made 3× PlayerHitsMap (fall 2 + L/R 1) exceed
   2571  f8c6							; overscan TIM64T=35 (~2240c) in 4-rect rooms → frame >262 lines → vertical
   2572  f8c6							; roll when strafing while falling.
   2573  f8c6							; Indexed by A>>2: 37 entries (idx 0-35 = A 0-143 = the player envelope
   2574  f8c6							; "Max A = PLAYER_MAX_Y+11 = 143", + idx36 = the tentacle-bob clamp, below).
   2575  f8c6							; Costs +4c/call vs the 192-entry table, saves 144 ROM bytes.
   2576  f8c6							; Row = idx/12 = scanline/48 (3 cave bands of 48 lines = rows 0-2).
   2577  f8c6							;
   2578  f8c6							; 36 entries: 12 each of 0,1,2 (value = index/12 = scanline/48) +
   2579  f8c6							; idx36 = 2: tentacle RoomY 133/134 (bob on spawn y=132) → A=(Y+11)>>2 =
   2580  f8c6							; 36 — WITHOUT this byte the lookup reads the OOB opcode ($A5 = `lda
   2581  f8c6							; RoomY`) → CollisionEndY garbage → cell walk false-hits ~24/32 bob
   2582  f8c6							; frames → measured 0.125 px/f vs the &1 gate's 0.5 (bugs.md #13).
   2583  f8c6							; Clamped value 2 = last cave row: box bottom (line 144-145) past the
   2584  f8c6							; cave (0-143) walks row 2 = floor wall, never PF0Buf+3 (row 3 = $C6,
   2585  f8c6							; not a buffer byte). Player never reaches idx36 (PLAYER_MAX_Y=122).
