   3193  fbe5							; StageSlot1 pad (2026-10-22): the Phase 5 slot-1 stager was evicted from the
   3194  fbe5							; $F744 fill to bank2 ($FAC0 block) — same split-pad contract as the exit pads:
   3195  fbe5							; bank0 runs the `sta $1FF8` here, the fetch at $FBE8 comes from BANK2 = `jmp
