   3694  fda9							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3695  fda9							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3696  fda9							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3697  fda9							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3698  fda9							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3699  fda9							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3700  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3701  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3702  fda9							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3703  fda9							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3704  fda9							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3705  fda9							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3706  fda9							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3707  fda9							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3708  fda9							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3709  fda9							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3710  fda9							;   in S3.0b.
   3711  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3712  fda9
   3713  fda9							; UpdateBombSound moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch A) — CallPad_UpdateBombSound.
