   3819  fe14							; ==============================================================================
   3820  fe14							; Phase 5 — second GRP1 object (no flicker). TIA has one GRP1 sprite, so two
   3821  fe14							; objects in a room used to alternate frames (30 Hz flicker each). When they
   3822  fe14							; live in DIFFERENT cave bands each can be drawn on ALL of its scanlines: the
   3823  fe14							; band's setup swaps the live trio (ObjBase/ObjTop/ActiveObjectX) for slot 1
   3824  fe14							; and repositions P1 there. The per-line object path is untouched — it already
   3825  fe14							; draws from the live trio and takes COLUP1 from ObjColorTab[ObjBase+row].
   3826  fe14							;
